    COP -. "tools: observe/send_message/<br/>read_messages/act + game://rules" .-> COP
    THIEF -. "no LLM inside (H3)" .-> THIEF
    GK -->|subprocess| LLM
    GK -->|http| OLL["Ollama :11434"]
    GK -->|google / smtp| MAIL["Gmail API / SMTP"]
